The port is not a verbatim copy: it computes the wrapped path's scalar LENGTH
only, omits the wrap-point sampling OpenSim generates for rendering, and does
not implement `WrapEllipsoid`. Every intentional difference is listed under
DEVIATIONS at the top of `MusclePathWrap.cpp`.

`BioMotion/Resources/FullBody.osim` and `BioMotion/Resources/Rajagopal2016.osim`
are OpenSim musculoskeletal models; their own licence terms are recorded in
STATUS.md ("The upper-limb licence blocker").

